                    <StackPanel Visibility="{variable:Clip1:Collapsed}">
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="1. 水下TNT" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="现实中炸药几乎不会含有钠，因为钠单质会与水剧烈反应而引燃炸药，钠离子则会吸水导致炸药受潮，其他形式的钠很少会存在。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="2. 毒树脂" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="“对以上的注释：这些词很好，但我找不到它们的用途[G]。点赞、评论并订阅！我们下次再见，拜拜！”（Comment on ^: These are nice, but I can&apos;t find a use for them [G]. Leave a like, leave a comment, and subscribe!, and see you in the next one, bye!）" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="3. 凋灵" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="凋灵的图案出现在了雕纹红砂岩的四个侧面中。" />
                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,2,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
